{"tag":"dark psychology","lines":[["How to make\nanyone want to\nimpress you","serif_italic",100,"white"],["#3 flips the power","sans",42,"gray"]],"dur":3.0},
{"tag":"step one","lines":[["Don't be\neasily impressed.","serif_italic",92,"white"],["When nothing wows you,\npeople start trying harder.","sans",44,"gray"]],"dur":3.4},
{"tag":"step two","lines":[["Praise effort,\nnot people.","serif_italic",92,"white"],["Specific praise is rare.\nThey'll work to earn it again.","sans",42,"gray"]],"dur":3.4},
{"tag":"step three","lines":[["Ask questions.\nListen. Say little.","serif_italic",88,"red"],["The quiet one in the room\nbecomes the one to impress.","sans",42,"gray"]],"dur":3.4},
{"tag":"step four","lines":[["Have standards\nyou never explain.","serif_italic",88,"white"],["Mystery creates effort.\nPeople chase what they can't read.","sans",40,"gray"]],"dur":3.4}
],"cover":true}
